  "notable_quotes": [
    "MOF 1 is structurally stable and can be made from inexpensive raw materials at only $614 per kilogram, supporting practical deployment.",
    "Single-crystal, DFT, and theoretical analyses indicate C2H2 adsorbs on the pore wall, not the channel center, and forms a wall-trapped tetramer.",
    "At 298 K and 0.1 bar, MOF 1 adsorbs 28.4 cm3 g−1 C2H2 and only 2.6 cm3 g−1 C2H4, with an IAST selectivity of 265 among benchmark MOFs."
  ],
